  "description": "The proposal seeks to improve the thermal performance, durability, usability, and overall residential quality of the existing structure through the replacement of the current lightweight translucent roof system and associated external alterations.\n\nThe proposed works include:\n\nRemoval of the existing plexiglass/translucent conservatory roof structure;\nInstallation of a new insulated warm roof construction finished with single ply membrane;\nRaising of the existing boundary-side wall from approximately 1600mm to approximately 2100mm;\nEstablishment of a revised eaves height of approximately 2100mm;\nThermal and weatherproofing improvements to create a more sustainable and usable year-round living space.\n\nThe proposal has been carefully designed to remain subordinate to the host dwelling while significantly improving residential amenity and building performance.",
